---
title: "Services: an advertising agency for the occasions that count"
description: "Retail listing, website relaunch, product launch, trade fair, international markets, rollout: six occasions for which industrial companies and brand manufacturers bring in Lünstroth."
permalink: /en/services/
key: /leistungen/
breadcrumbName: "Services"
ogImageSrc: "img/Listungsgespraech.jpg"
---
{%- set anlaesse = collections.anlassEn | sort(false, false, "data.anlassOrder") -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "headline": {{ title | dump | safe }},
  "description": {{ description | dump | safe }},
  "url": "https://luenstroth-werbeagentur.de/en/services/",
  "inLanguage": "en",
  "mainEntity": {
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "numberOfItems": {{ anlaesse | length }},
    "itemListElement": [
      {%- for l in anlaesse %}
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": {{ loop.index }},
        "name": {{ l.data.title | dump | safe }},
        "url": "https://luenstroth-werbeagentur.de{{ l.url }}"
      }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    ]
  }
}
</script>

{% from "hero-type.njk" import heroType %}
{{ heroType(
  "Advertising agency services: six occasions",
  ["You", "get", "called", "for", "a", "deadline"],
  "Not for “design” or “video”, but because a listing meeting is coming up, a trade fair, a launch, or a new brand presence that has to arrive everywhere. Design, copy and film are part of every one of these occasions."
) }}

<section class="container section-block section-block--close" style="max-width:1100px;">
  <div class="grid-2" style="background:none;gap:clamp(1.5rem,2.5vw,2.5rem);">
    {%- for a in anlaesse %}
    <a href="{{ a.url }}" class="card reveal{% if loop.index0 % 2 %} reveal-delay-1{% endif %}">
      <div class="card-num">{{ "0" + loop.index if loop.index < 10 else loop.index }}</div>
      <h2 class="card-title">{{ a.data.anlassName }}</h2>
      <p class="card-desc">{{ a.data.anlassTeaser }}</p>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container measure" style="padding-block:1rem 3rem;">
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">What every occasion contains</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Every mandate starts with a concept: who decides at this moment, by which criteria, and what do they need to see? Copy, design, film and technology follow from that — in the same team, so that nothing gets lost on the way.</p>
  <a href="/en/approach/" class="btn-arrow reveal reveal-delay-1">How we work →</a>
</section>

<section class="container measure" style="padding-block:1rem 3rem;">
  <div style="background:var(--paper-2);padding:2rem 2.25rem;border-left:2px solid var(--accent);">
    <p class="label" style="margin-bottom:.75rem;">Is the brand itself up for decision?</p>
    <p style="font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.8;">Positioning, brand architecture, naming, brand integration after an acquisition: these decisions come before each of the occasions above. They are the domain of <a href="https://luenstroth.com/en/brand-consultancy/" style="color:var(--accent);">Lünstroth brand consultancy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container measure" style="padding-block:1rem 7rem;">
  <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn-fill reveal">Start a project</a>
</section>
